&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SCP-CN-1572&lt;/strong&gt;-预定的流程&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;作者：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608712690&quot; alt=&quot;sciencekiller&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller&quot;  &gt;sciencekiller&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;和&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aplous&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6236003&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608712690&quot; alt=&quot;aplous&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6236003)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aplous&quot;  &gt;aplous&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
